	(text "What “enhancement‑mode” means for a p‑MOSFET\nFor a p‑channel device:\n\nOFF when \nVGS=0\n\nON only when \nVGS\n is negative enough (gate lower than source by the threshold voltage)\n\nTypical threshold for AO3413 is around –1.0 V to –2.5 V depending on current.\n\nSo:\n\nGate = 0 V\nSource = 4.2 V\n→ \nVGS=0−4.2=−4.2V\n → fully ON\n\nGate = 0 V\nSource = 0 V\n→ VGS=0\n → OFF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 75.438 118.872 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e8a61452-aee0-4d23-95c7-491cf9320bfd")
	)
